{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "12",
 "name": "Faenrae Reavers and Wind Hounds",
 "file": "Map12_Faenrae_Reavers_Wind_Hounds.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":-40,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Tunnel","descriptions":["Twin pillars of limestone divide the center of the tunnel into three graceful arches of equal size.  The fancy that these creations are of nature is shattered when you notice the glowing emeralds inset at the top of each arch, filling the room with a feverish green glow that reflects starkly off the limestone.  Toward the south the tunnel opens up more, which is compensated for by its narrowing to the north."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":14,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":2,"x":-40,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Tunnel","descriptions":["The steady drip drip drip of water echoes in from somewhere close, but for some reason you cannot divine the direction the sound is coming from.  The unsettling rhythm it sets is more than grating on the nerves.  Toward the south you can see the faint shine of the eerie green light that fills all the tunnels, while toward the west the shadows thicken and seem to draw into themselves."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":3,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":"go alcove"}]},
  {"id":3,"x":-60,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Tunnel","descriptions":["Large chunks of rocks lie thrown about here, natural born ruins of Hodierna's heart.  The tunnel twists at a right angle ahead, moving with the sharp grace of the World Dragon itself."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":4,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":4,"x":-80,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Rubble","descriptions":["Mounds of clutter and rubble lie packed around this room, the remains of a mining site that was abandoned before it could be properly dealt with."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":5,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":5,"x":-100,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Gentle Slope","descriptions":["The floor climbs slowly upward toward the south and west while the roof remains level, lending an appearance of awkwardness to the tunnel.  Rough shapes protrude from the walls, and it is only after a moment of staring that you realize the shapes bear a strong resemblance to Human faces, mouths wide open in shock and terror, and Human arms, desperately trying to claw their way out through a grave of stone."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":6,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":6,"x":-120,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Desolate Cavern","descriptions":["This underground chamber is filled with a pale, eerie green light that comes from no visible source.  Broken bits of stone, mangled remains of bodies, and rotting mementos of a past now scattered and gone are the only sign that this was once an active mining site."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":8,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":"go alcove"}]},
  {"id":7,"x":-100,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Alcove","descriptions":["This alcove, tucked away from the rest of the mine, sits like a lost child between the two wider service tunnels.  The floor holds a scattering of dirt across its surface along with an assorted collection of rubble.  A small shelf has been carved into one of the walls, its surface all but hidden by the shadows."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":6,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":8,"x":-140,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Desolate Cavern","descriptions":["A massive cavern yawns open about you, endlessly huge.  The ceiling and floors are lined in jagged stumps that were once whole stalactites and stalagmites, and shattered skeletal remains lie strewn about.  A deathly silence hangs heavy in the air, like a palpable curtain waiting to be drawn back.  The walls are scratched by claw marks, and the whole panorama hearkens to a raging tempest that whirlwinded through, tearing all within its path to shreds."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":9,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":9,"x":-120,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Tunnel","descriptions":["Broken bits of pottery, discarded mining picks, and remains of clothing and rags lie scattered about the floor.  The rock walls climb up around you, sealing out sound and lending a cramped feeling to the air."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":8,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":-120,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Tunnel","descriptions":["Old rusting hooks are still embedded in the rough walls of the tunnel, though they hold little but air these days.  Lichen grows in small clumps on the walls, filling the room with a fitful, unearthly illumination.  Scintillating out of the corner of your eye, minerals glitter in a Fae sugar-coating on the rocks and stones."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":11,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":11,"x":-80,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["This room is breathtakingly massive in size.  The walls shimmer like sheer glass, and the floor itself is made of a black, bubbled obsidian.  Cut into the low ceiling is a narrow opening that leads up to an abandoned mine shaft.  Faint light trickles through it, the only illumination and the one thing that still connects the cavern to the world that waits outside it."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":14,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":15,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":10,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":16,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":13,"x":-80,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["The west side of the cave slopes gradually downward, ending in a gentle curve where it meets the floor and creating a small cup in which subterranean water has begun to pool.  A sickly green glow -- the color of a wounded forest -- emanates from the water, casting the room in its light."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":14,"x":-40,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Tunnel","descriptions":["The floor of this bell-shaped room is smooth and level and so free of debris that it warrants suspicion.  An arching roof of smooth rock flies up overhead, fading off into the cave's natural darkness.  A pale greenish light from the north fills the cavern partially, becoming gradually watered down and consumed as it tries to reach south."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":11,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":15,"x":-60,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Cavern of Glass","descriptions":["A monstrous image awaits you here: the backside of a Human, preserved in the glass.  Shoved face-first into the obsidian walls, it is hard to tell what this hapless man's last expression was, but a guess would estimate that it was not a happy one.  Fickle light from the west plays off the pristine white of his clothing, preserved forever within the opaque surface."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":16,"x":-80,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Shaft","descriptions":["The smooth walls of the mine shaft rise up to either side of you, a glossy black color.  Some fifty feet of sheer wall rests between the platform you stand on, the one above you, and the mine floor far below."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":11,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":17,"x":-80,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Shaft","descriptions":["The smooth walls of the mine shaft rise up to either side of you, a glossy black color.  Some fifty feet of sheer wall rests between the platform you stand on, the one above you, and the next platform below."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":16,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":18,"x":-80,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Shaft","descriptions":["The smooth walls of the mine shaft rise up to either side, a glossy black color.  Some fifty feet of sheer wall rests between this platform, the opening above, and the next platform below."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":17,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":19,"x":-60,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Tunnel","descriptions":["The mine opens up into a somewhat larger room here, the walls extending up some fifty feet before shading off into darkness.  In the center of the chamber is a deep shaft that plunges as far down as the walls climb up.  The floor is oddly free of the debris that litters the rest of the mines."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":21,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":23,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":18,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":20,"x":-60,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Tunnel","descriptions":["The tunnel dead-ends here, choked by a wall of rubble and stone that blocks all further passage.  Chunks of rock lie strewn around you, and from beyond the stones you can hear a faint snickering sound.  A fine layer of dust lies over everything, and here and there you notice the faint tracings of footprints."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":21,"x":-40,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Tunnel","descriptions":["Luminescent fungi on the walls manages to lend light to this small, damp chamber.  Deep gouges cut through the ground, leaving glassy tracks and making the floor uneven."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":24,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":19,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":22,"x":0,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Tunnel","descriptions":["A rusting steel track is embedded into the cave floor here, running east ten feet before vanishing behind a wall of solid rock.  It is apparent from the stops at the visible end of the track that it began here, but hard to determine how it came to go through a wall, or how a wall came to grow up around it.  In the distance a repetitious dripping sound echoes through the cavern, doing nothing for the nerves."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":23,"x":-60,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Tunnel","descriptions":["Broken stones, abandoned tools, and wooden beams choke this bottleneck passageway.  The smooth stone walls rise up to either side, constricting movement and creating a pretty place for an ambush."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":24,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":24,"x":-60,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Tunnel","descriptions":["Strange noises bounce off the ragged stone ceiling, amplified by the quiet air of the night.  The dark is so thick that you can hardly see ahead, and the only thing clueing you toward the exit is the lapping sound of the lake shore coming from the south.  To the north the tunnel is choked with debris, but maneuverable."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":21,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":25,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":25,"x":-60,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Mines, Entrance","descriptions":["A jagged rip lies flush against the ebony mountainside, a layer of darkness against blackness against night.  Fine onyx sand lines the ground, its surface riddled with deep gouges, shattered glass, and broken support beams.  From within the mine's entrance you can hear odd snickering noises."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":39,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":26,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":26,"x":-80,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Clearing","descriptions":["The trees and undergrowth stop abruptly at the edge of this small clearing, the hard, cracked soil underfoot showing no sign of vegetation.  A broken cart lies near a cold fire pit in the center of the clearing, several pieces of unused firewood poking their heads over its splintered sides.  A small cave leads into the rocky hillside."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":"go cave"}]},
  {"id":27,"x":-160,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Gazit Lair, Grotto","descriptions":["A slight breeze mingles fresh, damp air from the outside with the musty dryness of this ancient cave.  The ground rises slightly as it heads north into the center of the lair."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":33,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":28,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":26,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":28,"x":-180,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Gazit Lair, Grotto","descriptions":["Ambient light dances across the face of a large crystalline formation that stretches from floor to ceiling, teasing ever-changing shadows across the room.  To the left of the crystals, a flow of smooth limestone has shaped itself into a natural staircase leading up to the rock lip encircling the chamber."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":30,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":32,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":27,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":36,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stair"}]},
  {"id":29,"x":-180,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Gazit Lair, Grotto","descriptions":["Milky-white deposits of limestone cascade down the northwest wall in formation created long ago but long since dried and dead.  A casualty of the near-total darkness, a spindly, single-leafed stalk hangs limply over the edge of a cracked clay pot that squats near one of the doors set into the walls of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":32,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":28,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":30,"x":-160,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Gazit Lair, Grotto","descriptions":["Velvety limestone draperies flow down the far wall, adding a superficial appearance of softness to the rock's surface.  A number of flat, grey stones have been stacked into a tower of precarious steps leading up to a wide rock lip that encirles the entire cavern."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":33,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":32,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":28,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":29,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":-140,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Gazit Lair, Grotto","descriptions":["Silent stalactites glint far overhead with an eerie iridescence that lights the entire cavern in a pale, green glow.  A pile of large boulders along one wall give shelter to a tiny opening nestled in the rock face."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":32,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":30,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":32,"x":-160,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Gazit Lair, Fire Pit","descriptions":["Rows of stacked stones surround a deep firepit in the center of the dirt floor.  A mass of ash, pieces of blackened wood and small bits of fire-greyed bone fill the pit, their presence adding a slight scent of char to the air.  Several large stone benches line the walls, chiseled from the cave's native limestone."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":31,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":33,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":27,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":28,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":29,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":33,"x":-140,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Gazit Lair, Grotto","descriptions":["An array of intertwining crystalline vines laces the jagged rock walls, their smooth, dry surfaces gleaming dully in the ambient light.  Crude steps chiseled into the walls lead up to a wide stone ledge.  A fine patina of dust covers the floor, roiling into brown clouds with the slightest disturbance."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":27,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":32,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":30,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":34,"exit":"climb","move":"climb step"}]},
  {"id":34,"x":-120,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Gazit Lair, Karik Rim","descriptions":["This large stone ledge, wide enough for a yak caravan to travel, circles the entire rim of the cavern.  A series of crude drawings have been sketched along the walls, their images showing miniature Gor'Togs standing in an endless battle against creatures frozen in time."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":35,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":35,"x":-160,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Gazit Lair, Karik Rim","descriptions":["A row of stalagmites form a natural railing along the lip of the stone walkway underfoot, lending a modicum of protection against falling to the cavern floor below.  The air is slightly warmer here than the rest of the cave."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":36,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":-200,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Gazit Lair, Karik Rim","descriptions":["A stream of cool water trickles from a narrow crack in the rock wall and onto the floor, forming a small pool.  An even smaller rivulet dribbles from the other side of the pool, spreading across the nearby rock to evaporate into the warm, dry air."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":37,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":28,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stair"}]},
  {"id":37,"x":-180,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Gazit Lair, Karik Rim","descriptions":["A painting of a huge, four-legged creature dominates the near wall of this section of the chamber.  A plethora of runic symbols encircle the figure, interspersed between them the outlines of several large handprints.  The entire piece has been painted in the same, unvarying ochre hue."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":36,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":38,"x":-140,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Gazit Lair, Karik Rim","descriptions":["A pile of discarded skulls and bones lies at the base of one wall, gleaming dully in the dim light.  The walls here are stained a smokey grey, darker near the lower areas where an abandoned firepit is slowly being consumed by the steady accumulation of dust on the cavern's floor."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":37,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":39,"x":-60,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Forest Path, Rocky Shore","descriptions":["A shattered wood beam crosses your path here, the remnants of a house that has now long since vanished.  Fragments of rocks lie scattered across the ground, turning treacherously underfoot.  The ground creates odd embankments, as if the hand of a god pushed it back with one quick, idle brush."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":40,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":40,"x":-60,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Forest Path, Rocky Shore","descriptions":["The trees cling to a tedious life along the path that winds around the shore of the Silverwater Lake.  The ground is firmly packed, and ruts dig deeply into the earth on either side, remnants of a once thriving community.  The dead slap of water against water brings an eerie echo up from the lake shore."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":41,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":41,"x":-40,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Forest Path, Rocky Shore","descriptions":["The trees grow unsteadily along this rocky patch of ground, and in many places they have fallen.  The lapping of water greets your ears to the west, and glancing in that direction you can see a small lake the color of dull lead, its shores reaching all the way to the edge of a mountain range that makes an ugly black slash across the horizon."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":40,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":43,"exit":"go","move":"go shore"}]},
  {"id":42,"x":-20,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Forest Path","descriptions":["The trees that grow here just barely comprise a forest, their tortured, claw-like branches scraping the sky and rendering them so malformed it is impossible to tell what type of tree they are.  A matted layer of thick, molding leaves cover the floor, filling the air with a miasma-like stench that makes your stomach cringe."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":41,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":43,"x":-20,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Lake, Shore","descriptions":["The dull, listless waters of Silverwater Lake spread out before you, a rippling matte mirror.  Except for the choppy slap of the waves against the black sands of the shore, the lake is quiet and devoid of any sign of fish or wildlife."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":41,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}]},
  {"id":44,"x":0,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Lake, Shore","descriptions":["A steep bank of rocks and dirt climbs up to the east, creating a short but unclimbable wall.  To the west the water of Silverwater Lake thrashes in its death throes, sucking away at the pebbled sands of the shore.  The stillness is unsettling, and a little frightening."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":45,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":45,"x":-20,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Lake, Shore","descriptions":["Quarry piled along the shore and the remnants of a deep channel that leads up to the mines indicates that this may have once been the place where the miners dumped the remains of the day's excursions.  A fine, gritty layer of black covers everything, and the water is noticeably darker by comparison to the rest of the lake."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":46,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":46,"x":-40,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Silverwater Lake, Shore","descriptions":["The shoreline becomes more and more rocky until it finally turns into the treacherous mountainside.  Tall and majestic, the range cups the lake in a halfmoon shape.  An earthquake from time immemorial has split the part of the mountain's side that faces Silverwater, leaving a sheer wall of granite that dives straight down into the water with reckless abandon.  A splendid and awe-inspiring cataract topples aimlessly over the straightest cliff, feeding the lake but never dispelling its grim hue."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":47,"x":0,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Forest Path","descriptions":["Signs of sickening cling to the trees and the whisper of unseen creatures moving about alerts you to the fact that you are not alone.  The ground is a blasted, black color, and dry stalks of grass that hold no promise of life poke up from the barren earth.  To the northwest clamber a set of mountains that look less than a mile away, if that."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":42,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":48,"x":20,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Forest Path","descriptions":["The trees seem to hold an aura of fragility about them, as if the burden of the moss that drips from their boughs weighs them down to the point of snapping.  Odd carvings have been hung from the branches of the trees, their stone and wooden visages stirring on the wind and clattering against one another."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":47,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":49,"x":40,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Northern Trade Road, Deep Forest","descriptions":["Heavy, still air hangs in pockets about you, weighing down sound and movement.  Silent in their misery, the trees hunch over each other, their boughs and trunks hidden by clinging moss.  They pull the sickly-colored stuff about them the way a Human child hides under a security blanket."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":48,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}],"linksTo":"Map7_NTR_Part1.xml"}
 ],
 "labels": [
  {"text":"New Label","x":103180,"y":-5280,"z":0},
  {"text":"Faenrae Reavers, Wind Hounds","x":-160,"y":-80,"z":0},
  {"text":"Faenrae Reavers, Wind Hounds","x":-20,"y":250,"z":0}
 ]
}
